	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">In causa vocationis meae, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> in domine <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>charissime, nihildum prorsus actum est.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Desyderabatur <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>praesentia <persName ref="p8018">Halleri</persName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rediit ille prima mensis huius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Post illius reditum non video, quid impediat amplius, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nisi forsan legati expectantur, quos ad conventum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l21">Badensem</placeName> miserunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Fero has moras haud illibenter <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>propter futuram synodum, et arbitratur alioqui <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> praesentiam quęstoris <persName ref="p8018">Halleri</persName> fore rebus meis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non incommodam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interea satis amanter tractor <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>a fratribus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Video ecclesiam hanc non in urbe <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>modo, sed et in agro, praesertim <placeName ref="l832">Gallico</placeName>, nondum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad solidum esse pacatam; quare prorsus opus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>erit, ut, etiam si ego hic maneam, retineatur <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>simul <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName>, cuius mansuetudine ac mode<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ratione multa corrigi possunt, cuius etiam doctri<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nam civitatis huius populus mirum in modum appetit, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut appareat illum ab hac ecclesia non sine grandi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>detrimento et auditorum distractione posse <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>avelli.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dum hac illi de re loquor, dicit se, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quicquid huius sit, in senatus vestri potestatem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>reiicere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tuum itaque erit dominos vestros illic harum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>rerum gnaros reddere.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Servitur quidem Christo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>et illic; verum quoniam hic maior viget necessitas, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>relinquenda est vestra et isti succurrendum ecclesię, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quę revera misere alioqui discerpta iacet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Verum hęc ipse melius nosti et dubie procul <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sollicite expendis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Ceterum de stipendio, ut ex fratribus hic audio, periculum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>est, ne non satis pro necessitate tam numerosę meae <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>familiae constituatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Numerantur concionatoribus singulis floreni centum et 10 <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>urcei vini, quale in vicinia crescit, et modii frumenti <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>24, ut ad summum stipendium sit florenorum 150, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>quod quomodo mihi ac meis sufficere possit, ipse satis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>coniicere potes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Sufficit quidem reliquis, D. <persName ref="p1804">Jodoco</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName ref="p8467">Webero</persName>; sed ille unum tantum filium, hic unicam <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>habet filiam.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Obsecro, si interea temporis, dum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>hic hęreo, aliquid hac in re efficere poteris, ut <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>facias.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Optime vale, virorum observandissime.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>toti domui tuę, reliquis dominis ac fratribus meis <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>omnibus et <persName ref="p8440">Gervasio</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 5. Martii 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8417">W[olfga<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ngus] Musculus</persName>, tuus <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo theologo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>M. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>lingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesię pastori <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>domino ac fratri <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>in Christo charissimo.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>An meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrich <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Bullinger</persName> zu <placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
